{"parse":{"title":"Burning","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Burning</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/4/45/Burning.png/revision/latest?cb=20221128180845\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Burning\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/4/45/Burning.png/revision/latest?cb=20221128180845\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/4/45/Burning.png/revision/latest?cb=20221128180845 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/4/45/Burning.png/revision/latest?cb=20221128180845 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Burning\" width=\"64\" height=\"62\" data-image-key=\"Burning.png\" data-image-name=\"Burning.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t<figcaption class=\"pi-item-spacing pi-caption\">You are on fire!</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"effects\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Effects</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">X damage per tick</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Burning</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_effect\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status effect\">status effect</a> caused by taking <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_types#Fire\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage types\">Fire</a> damage, for example by walking into a fire or getting hit by a fireball. It lasts for five seconds and ticks every second. Taking additional fire damage will stack damage on top of the current burning effect and recalculate the tick damage. Tick damage can be calculated with:\n</p><p><big><span class=\"mwe-math-element\"><span class=\"mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y\" style=\"display: none;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"{\\displaystyle {total \\ damage \\over duration}}\">\n  <semantics>\n    <mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n      <mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\">\n        <mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n          <mfrac>\n            <mrow>\n              <mi>t</mi>\n              <mi>o</mi>\n              <mi>t</mi>\n              <mi>a</mi>\n              <mi>l</mi>\n              <mtext>&#xa0;</mtext>\n              <mi>d</mi>\n              <mi>a</mi>\n              <mi>m</mi>\n              <mi>a</mi>\n              <mi>g</mi>\n              <mi>e</mi>\n            </mrow>\n            <mrow>\n              <mi>d</mi>\n              <mi>u</mi>\n              <mi>r</mi>\n              <mi>a</mi>\n              <mi>t</mi>\n              <mi>i</mi>\n              <mi>o</mi>\n              <mi>n</mi>\n            </mrow>\n          </mfrac>\n        </mrow>\n      </mstyle>\n    </mrow>\n    <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">{\\displaystyle {total \\ damage \\over duration}}</annotation>\n  </semantics>\n</math></span><img src=\"https://services.fandom.com/mathoid-facade/v1/media/math/render/svg/626ac42ee1a544e9e2357b8c4aebd70df429748e\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align: -2.005ex; max-width:14.062ex; max-height:5.509ex;\" alt=\"{\\displaystyle {total\\ damage \\over duration}}\" /></span></big>\n</p><p>Burning deals <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_types#Pure\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage types\">Pure</a> damage. Armor and Fire resistance indirectly affect the effect by reducing Fire damage, however they do not affect already acquired effects.<span></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBurning%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Burning expires 6x faster while being <a href=\"/wiki/Wet_Effect\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wet Effect\">Wet</a>.</li>\n<li>Being Wet expires ~60x faster while burning.</li>\n<li>The player is unable to receive the <a href=\"/wiki/Resting_Effect\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resting Effect\">resting effect</a> while burning.</li>\n<li>Standing on a <a href=\"/wiki/Campfire\" title=\"Campfire\">Campfire</a> with 26 or more armor will not cause burning, as the Fire damage is reduced to less than 1. This assumes no weakness to Fire damage.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"Show\" data-collapsetext=\"Hide\"><tbody><tr class=\"navbox-title\"><th colspan=\"2\" scope=\"col\"><span class=\"navbox-vde\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:EffectsNav\" title=\"Template:EffectsNav\"><span title=\"View this navbox template\">v</span></a> · <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://valheim.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:EffectsNav\"><span title=\"Discuss this navbox template\">d</span></a> · <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://valheim.fandom.com/wiki/Template:EffectsNav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this navbox template\">e</span></a></span></span><div class=\"navbox-title-pad navbox-title-padleft navbox-title-padright\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_effects\" title=\"Status effects\">Status effects</a></div></th></tr><tr class=\"navbox-gutter\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-row\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\">Environment</th><td class=\"navbox-list\"><div class=\"hlist\"><a href=\"/wiki/No_skill_drain\" title=\"No skill drain\">No skill drain</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Corpse_run\" title=\"Corpse run\">Corpse run</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Encumbered\" title=\"Encumbered\">Encumbered</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Resting\" title=\"Resting\">Resting</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Rested\" title=\"Rested\">Rested</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Shelter\" title=\"Shelter\">Shelter</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Wet\" title=\"Wet\">Wet</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_(effect)\" title=\"Fire (effect)\">Fire</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\">Cold</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Freezing\" title=\"Freezing\">Freezing</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Tarred\" title=\"Tarred\">Tarred</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Slimed\" title=\"Slimed\">Slimed</a></div></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-gutter\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-row alt\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\">Damage</th><td class=\"navbox-list\"><div class=\"hlist\"><a href=\"/wiki/Smoked\" title=\"Smoked\">Smoked</a> • <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Burning</strong> • <a href=\"/wiki/Frost_(effect)\" title=\"Frost (effect)\">Frost</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\">Poison</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_(effect)\" title=\"Lightning (effect)\">Lightning</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Feeling_sick\" title=\"Feeling sick\">Feeling sick</a></div></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-gutter\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-row\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\">Equipment</th><td class=\"navbox-list\" style=\"background: none\"><div class=\"hlist\"></div><table class=\"navbox-subgroup\"><tbody><tr class=\"navbox-row\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\">Weapons</th><td class=\"navbox-list\"><div class=\"hlist\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abyssal_harpoon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Abyssal harpoon\">Harpooned</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_barrier\" title=\"Magic barrier\">Magic barrier</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Chain_lightning\" title=\"Chain lightning\">Chain lightning</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Immobilized\" title=\"Immobilized\">Immobilized</a></div></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-gutter\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-row alt\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\">Equipment</th><td class=\"navbox-list\"><div class=\"hlist\"><a href=\"/wiki/Megingjord\" title=\"Megingjord\">Megingjord</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Wishbone\" title=\"Wishbone\">Wishbone</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Wisplight\" title=\"Wisplight\">Wisplight</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Feather_fall\" title=\"Feather fall\">Feather fall</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Wind_run\" title=\"Wind run\">Wind run</a></div></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-gutter\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-row\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\">Set bonuses</th><td class=\"navbox-list\"><div class=\"hlist\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sneaky\" title=\"Sneaky\">Sneaky</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Berserk\" title=\"Berserk\">Berserk</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Improved_archery\" title=\"Improved archery\">Improved archery</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Fenris_blessing\" title=\"Fenris blessing\">Fenris blessing</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Vilebone_wrath\" title=\"Vilebone wrath\">Vilebone wrath</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Ask%27s_endurance\" title=\"Ask&#39;s endurance\">Ask's endurance</a></div></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"hlist\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017173028\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.080 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 140/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9323/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 48/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size